  <p id="c-nanshi-070-ruanshimen-parent:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-070-ruanshimen-parent:p001:m0000" ref="qkt_yf2_rsg">長之</persName>固遣送曰：「一生不侮暗室。」前後所蒞官，皆有風政，爲後人所思。宋世言善政者咸稱之。文帝深惜之，曰：「<persName id="c-nanshi-070-ruanshimen-parent:p001:m0052" ref="qkt_yf2_rsg">景茂</persName>方堪大用，豈直以清苦見惜。」子<persName id="c-nanshi-070-ruanshimen-parent:p001:m0069" ref="qkt_yf2_rsg_A">師門</persName>，原鄕令。</p>
</text>
